00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,588
D, copper.

2
00:00:01,588 --> 00:00:13,971
Its standard reduction potential, plus zero point three four volts, is above hydrogen's zero, so it is a weaker reducing agent than hydrogen and cannot push hydrogen ions to hydrogen gas.

3
00:00:13,971 --> 00:00:18,632
Zinc, magnesium and iron all have negative potentials.

